title: "TransferRes: Transferable Perturbational Resolution"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-09-13"
type: software

authors:
  - family-names: "Liu"
    given-names: "Jin-Ming"

doi: "10.5281/zenodo.22736901"

repository-code: "https://github.com/jinming3553-creator/TransferRes"
url: "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22736901"

license: MIT

abstract: >
  TransferRes estimates transferable perturbational resolution using
  biological-unit holdout prediction, partial-pooling diagnostics,
  hierarchy-preserving permutation, identifiability analysis, and
  data-matched signal detectability calibration.
